content:
One ordering number (TSD003-S31C-SO) and one technical-data block tie the parameters together; 50 Gbaud / one optical lane and 53.125 Gbd / 100GAUI-2 are different layers of the same configuration, not separate selectable modes.

```json
{
  "modes": [
    {
      "label": "100G-LR SFP-DD (TSD003-S31C-SO)",
      "standards_code": "100G-LR",
      "baud_rate_gbaud": 53.125,
      "bit_rate_gbps": 103.12,
      "fec_type": "RS_544_514",
      "number_of_lanes": 2
    }
  ]
}
```
